                                                "sense_id": "cec61168-7c19-3b84-9115-ef9f053f1cf0",
                                                "text": "We have various events or processes, therefore: cuttings, kickings, humiliatings, panickings, puncturings, smashings, blowings, and swellings. These are the things that really go on in the world and causation is perhaps just a label […]"
